.TH COREUTILS "1" "2026-07-28" "BNU 9.11" "BNU Commands"
.SH NAME
coreutils \- dispatch to a BNU command module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B coreutils
\fI\,--coreutils-prog=PROGRAM_NAME \/\fR[\fI\,PARAMETERS\/\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.\" This page is derived from GNU Coreutils documentation.
This page documents BNU, an independent Bun implementation compatible with
GNU Coreutils 9.11.
.PP
Load and execute the PROGRAM_NAME single\-call module with the given PARAMETERS.
.TP
\X'tty: link https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/coreutils#coreutils--help'\fB\-\-help\fP\X'tty: link'
display this help and exit
.TP
\X'tty: link https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/coreutils#coreutils--version'\fB\-\-version\fP\X'tty: link'
output version information and exit
.PP
Use: 'coreutils \fB\-\-coreutils\-prog\fR=\fI\,PROGRAM_NAME\/\fR \fB\-\-help\fR' for individual program help.
